{"path":"fees.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Plans & Fees — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfc;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#6b4cff;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;color:#111827;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbfd 0%,#f7f8fb 100%);}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:transparent}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a06bff);color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .hero{padding:40px 28px 32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:32px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)}
    .kicker{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    h1{margin:8px 0 6px;font-size:24px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
    .plans{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .plan{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .plan .meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .price{font-weight:800;color:#0f172a}
    .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Session Planner */
    .planner{padding:18px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,76,255,0.06),rgba(167,127,255,0.02));border:1px dashed rgba(107,76,255,0.12)}
    label{font-weight:600;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a}
    select,input[type="number"],textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;margin-top:6px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    footer{padding:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* subtle decorative pattern using inline SVG as CSS background */
    .bg-pattern{background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='400' height='200' viewBox='0 0 400 200'><defs><linearGradient id='g' x1='0' x2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='%236b4cff' stop-opacity='0.05'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='%23a06bff' stop-opacity='0.02'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(%23g)'/><g fill='none' stroke='%236b4cff' stroke-opacity='0.06' stroke-width='1'><path d='M0 40c40 20 80-20 120 0s80 60 120 40 80-40 120-20' /></g></svg>");background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right top;background-size:contain}

    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.hero-card{order:2}.brand .logo{width:40px;height:40px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Nest</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method Lab</a>
      <a href="fees.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Plans</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Learn</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-card bg-pattern">
        <div class="kicker">Plans & practical options</div>
        <h1>Flexible ways to work together</h1>
        <p class="lead">Choose a rhythm that fits your life. Below are typical options and an interactive planner to help you map a short-term aim or a softer ongoing rhythm.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:18px" class="plans">
          <div class="plan" aria-hidden>
            <div class="meta">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Intro Conversation</div>
              <div class="note">One 45-minute session to set focus and questions.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price">$160</div>
              <div class="note">Sliding scale available on request</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan">
            <div class="meta">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Focused Series (6 sessions)</div>
              <div class="note">A short, focused set for a specific concern or decision.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price">$900 (6 × 45min)</div>
              <div class="note">Session length options: 30 / 45 / 60 min</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan">
            <div class="meta">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Support Rhythm</div>
              <div class="note">Ongoing sessions tailored to steady support and practice.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div class="price">From $150/session</div>
              <div class="note">Custom package and frequency available</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="small" style="margin-top:14px">I offer a limited number of lower-fee openings. If cost is a barrier, ask about a fee adjustment when you reach out.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-card">
        <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Session Planner</div>
        <p class="note">Build a short plan to share in your first visit — estimate rhythm, session length, and key focus. This is a planning tool, not a diagnosis.</p>

        <form id="planner" class="planner" onsubmit="return false;">
          <label>Primary intention</label>
          <select id="intent">
            <option>Manage daily stress & overwhelm</option>
            <option>Navigate a transition (work, move, relationship)</option>
            <option>Improve communication or relationships</option>
            <option>Support parenting or caregiving</option>
            <option>Clarify priorities & balance</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>

          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="row">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label>Session length</label>
              <select id="length"><option value="30">30 min</option><option value="45" selected>45 min</option><option value="60">60 min</option></select>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label>Cadence</label>
              <select id="cadence"><option value="weekly">Weekly</option><option value="biweekly">Every other week</option><option value="monthly">Monthly check-in</option></select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <label>Number of sessions you expect to start with</label>
            <input id="count" type="number" value="6" min="1" />
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <label>Anything else to share (optional)</label>
            <textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="A few words about what matters to you..."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button id="build">Create plan</button>
            <button id="copy" class="secondary" type="button">Copy summary</button>
          </div>

          <div id="summary" style="margin-top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;min-height:62px"></div>
        </form>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:0 28px">
      <div class="hero-card" style="margin-bottom:12px">
        <div style="font-weight:700">How I think about fees</div>
        <p class="note">I try to be clear and flexible: listed fees are typical starting points. During our first conversation we can explore what might work for you, including a different session length or an alternative cadence.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Boundaries & confidentiality</div>
        <p class="note">Sessions are confidential within the limits of the law. I will explain what those limits are and how I handle records. I do not provide emergency services. If you are in crisis or feel unsafe, please call your local emergency number or a crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px">
      <div>Questions? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <div><a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none"><button style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Session Planner logic
    function pricePerSession(len){
      // approximate values from page: 30=>150, 45=>160, 60=>190
      if(len==30) return 140;
      if(len==45) return 160;
      return 190;
    }

    function buildText(){
      const intent=document.getElementById('intent').value;
      const length=+document.getElementById('length').value;
      const cadence=document.getElementById('cadence').value;
      const count=+document.getElementById('count').value;
      const notes=document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();
      const rate=pricePerSession(length);
      const estTotal=(rate*count).toFixed(0);

      const lines=[];
      lines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Session Plan');
      lines.push('Intention: '+intent);
      lines.push('Session length: '+length+' min');
      lines.push('Cadence: '+cadence);
      lines.push('Planned sessions: '+count);
      lines.push('Estimated per-session fee: $'+rate+' (typical starting point)');
      lines.push('Estimated total for initial block: $'+estTotal);
      if(notes) lines.push('Notes: '+notes);
      lines.push('Bring this summary to your first conversation to help set focus.');
      lines.push('Contact: {{PHONE}} | {{EMAIL}}');
      return lines.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('build').addEventListener('click',function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      document.getElementById('summary').textContent=buildText();
    });

    document.getElementById('copy').addEventListener('click',function(){
      const txt=document.getElementById('summary').textContent || buildText();
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>{
        const orig=this.textContent; this.textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(()=>this.textContent=orig,1500);
      },()=>{alert('Could not copy. You can select and copy the summary.')});
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"faq.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Learn & FAQs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff;--muted:#52525b;--accent:#0ea5a4}
    body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff 0%,#fbfdff 100%);color:#0f172a}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 24px}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#06b6d4,#14b8a6);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 18px}
    h1{font-size:22px;margin:6px 0}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px}
    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.04)}
    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}
    .q{font-weight:700}
    .a{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
    .wizard{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    label{font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
    input,select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eef2}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .copy{background:#e6f6f5;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    footer{margin:28px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media (max-width:920px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div><div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Practical therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div></div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Nest</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method Lab</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Plans</a>
      <a href="faq.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Learn</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <h1>Questions people often ask</h1>
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="faq-item"><div class="q">How do I know therapy is a fit?</div><div class="a">Most people start with an introductory session to see if the style and focus feel useful. We’ll talk about what matters to you, practical next steps, and whether continuing together would help.</div></div>

          <div class="faq-item"><div class="q">How confidential are sessions?</div><div class="a">Conversations are private within legal limits. I will review confidentiality and record-keeping before we begin. If you have particular concerns about privacy, bring them up and I’ll explain how I handle notes and communications.</div></div>

          <div class="faq-item"><div class="q">What if I need help between appointments?</div><div class="a">I do not provide crisis services. If you are in danger or an emergency, call local emergency services or your crisis line. For non-urgent check-ins we can discuss safe ways to communicate, including brief messages or scheduling an extra session.</div></div>

          <div class="faq-item"><div class="q">Do you accept insurance?</div><div class="a">I do not bill insurance directly. I can provide a receipt (superbill) that you may submit to your insurer for possible reimbursement. Policies and coverage vary; contacting your provider is the best way to know.</div></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Still curious? Try the intake wiz</div>
          <p class="a">A short guided set of prompts to help you notice what matters and gather questions for a first meeting. Non-diagnostic — meant to prepare a constructive first conversation.</p>

          <div id="wiz" class="wizard" style="margin-top:10px">
            <label>What brings you here? (a few words)</label>
            <input id="w1" placeholder="E.g., stress at work, a relationship shift, parenting fatigue" />

            <label>When did you first notice this?</label>
            <select id="w2"><option>Within last month</option><option>1–3 months</option><option>Several months</option><option>Longstanding</option></select>

            <label>What would help you know this is going well?</label>
            <input id="w3" placeholder="A specific outcome or experience you'd like" />

            <label>Any practical constraints (time, childcare, budgeting)?</label>
            <input id="w4" placeholder="Short note helps guide planning" />

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button id="wizBuild">Create question list</button>
              <button id="wizCopy" class="copy" type="button">Copy to clipboard</button>
            </div>

            <div id="wizOut" style="margin-top:10px;background:#f8fafc;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;min-height:68px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:monospace"></div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700">A clinician's note</div>
          <p class="a">I aim to be direct, practical, and human. Therapy is collaborative; we’ll set goals together and check in about what’s working. If you have concerns about diagnosis, medication, or safety I will refer or coordinate with other professionals as appropriate.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Confidentiality & safety</div>
          <p class="a">Conversations are confidential except in situations where disclosure is required by law (risk of harm, abuse, or court order). If safety is a concern I will help you access urgent support. I do not offer emergency services.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Ready to talk?</div>
          <p class="a">If you'd like to schedule an initial conversation, use the Reserve link or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong>. You can also email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:10px"><a href="book.html"><button style="width:100%">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></a></p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <p>Note: This page is for informational purposes and to help you prepare for a conversation. It is not a substitute for emergency care.</p>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Intake wizard - generates suggested questions for first session
    function generateQuestions(){
      const b1=document.getElementById('w1').value.trim();
      const t=document.getElementById('w2').value;
      const goal=document.getElementById('w3').value.trim();
      const constraints=document.getElementById('w4').value.trim();

      const q=[];
      q.push('Prepared intake notes — bring these to your first visit');
      q.push('1) In my own words: "'+(b1||'')+'"');
      q.push('2) How long I've noticed this: '+t);
      if(goal) q.push('3) What I hope will be different: "'+goal+'"');
      else q.push('3) What I hope will be different: (fill in during session)');
      if(constraints) q.push('4) Practical constraints to consider: "'+constraints+'"');
      if(b1) q.push('5) Things I'm worried the clinician should know: (add items)');

      q.push('\nSuggested questions to ask during the first conversation:');
      q.push('- What would you suggest as a first set of steps?');
      q.push('- How do you typically track progress and adjust focus?');
      q.push('- What support do you suggest between sessions if needed?');
      q.push('- What are your confidentiality practices and how do you handle records?');

      q.push('\nContact details: {{PHONE}} | {{EMAIL}}');
      return q.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('wizBuild').addEventListener('click',function(e){
      e.preventDefault(); document.getElementById('wizOut').textContent=generateQuestions();
    });

    document.getElementById('wizCopy').addEventListener('click',function(){
      const txt=document.getElementById('wizOut').textContent || generateQuestions();
      navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>{const o=this.textContent; this.textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(()=>this.textContent=o,1400)},()=>alert('Copy failed'));
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Reserve a Conversation — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff;--muted:#444;--accent:#7c3aed}
    body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;margin:0;background:#f7f8fb;color:#0f172a}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 22px}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#a78bfa);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}
    .wrap{max-width:900px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)}
    h1{margin:4px 0 12px}
    label{font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
    input,select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eef2;width:100%}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    @media (max-width:820px){.row{flex-direction:column}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div><div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div><div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Reserve a conversation</div></div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Nest</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method Lab</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Plans</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Learn</a>
      <a href="book.html" style="color:var(--accent)">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Reserve a first conversation</h1>
      <p class="muted">Use this form to describe what matters and to prepare for an initial scheduling call. If you prefer, call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>

      <form id="bookForm" onsubmit="return false;" style="margin-top:14px;display:grid;gap:10px">
        <div class="row">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label>Your name</label>
            <input id="name" placeholder="Full name" />
          </div>
          <div style="width:220px">
            <label>Preferred contact</label>
            <input id="contact" placeholder="Phone or email" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <label>What would you like to focus on?</label>
        <select id="focus">
          <option>Stress & time management</option>
          <option>Life transition (career, move, relationship)</option>
          <option>Relationship or family matters</option>
          <option>Parenting support</option>
          <option>Work/life balance</option>
          <option>Other</option>
        </select>

        <div class="row">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label>When did this start to matter?</label>
            <select id="when"><option>Within the last month</option><option>1–3 months</option><option>Several months</option><option>Longstanding</option></select>
          </div>
          <div style="width:220px">
            <label>Session length</label>
            <select id="len"><option value="45" selected>45 min</option><option value="60">60 min</option><option value="30">30 min</option></select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <label>Any practical notes (childcare, scheduling, fee concerns)?</label>
        <input id="practical" placeholder="Short note" />

        <p class="muted">Below is a short intake tool to help you reflect on what you might bring to a first visit. It produces a short list you can copy into the message or bring with you.</p>

        <div style="background:#fbfdff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px">
          <label>Quick intake prompt</label>
          <textarea id="brief" rows="3" placeholder="A few words about what's most important to you..."></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button id="toSummary">Generate visit summary</button>
            <button id="copySummary" class="" type="button">Copy summary</button>
          </div>
          <div id="visitSummary" style="margin-top:10px;background:white;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;min-height:60px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:monospace"></div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px">
          <button id="send">Send request</button>
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}"><button type="button" style="background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent);">Book via portal</button></a>
        </div>

